#==============================================================================================
#
#   interpolation_3 - CSS interpolation: 4x4 matrices and transform lists
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/CSS/Interpolation.cpp (lines 835-1376), by region p4a:
#       decomposing a 3D matrix into translation, scale, skew, rotation (a quaternion) and
#       perspective, interpolating the decomposed values and recomposing them; a matrix as
#       matrix3d() values; and the interpolation of transform lists (padding the shorter list
#       with identity functions, converting each pair to its common 2D or 3D primitive, and
#       interpolating the remaining functions as matrices).
#
#       Copyright (c) 2024, Matthew Olsson <mattco@serenityos.org>
#       Copyright (c) 2025-2026, Tim Ledbetter <tim.ledbetter@ladybird.org>
